{"ID":"20240205153634-63hrane","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153634-63hrane","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153634-63hrane\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103142-qjoknei\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617103947-fiw1k53\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620152529-r9kiaa6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"100酸枣（酸枣仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240809095842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103142-qjoknei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103142-qjoknei","updated":"20240206103150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河北省、陕西省、辽宁省、河南省等地。\n【性状】\t干燥成熟的种子呈扁圆形或椭圆形，表面紫红色或紫褐色，平滑有光泽，有的有裂纹。有的两面均承圆隆状突起，有的一面较平州。中间或有1条隆起的纵线纹；另一面稍突起。一端凹陷，可见线形种脐，另端有细小突起的合点。种皮较脆，乳白色。子叶2，浅黄色，富油性。 气微弱，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，酸，平。\n【功效】\t养心补肝，宁心安神，敛汗，生津。用于虑烦不眠，惊悸多梦，体虚多汗，津伤口渴。\n【炙品】\t炒酸枣仁：取净酸枣仁，照清炒法炒至鼓起，色微变深。用时捣碎。形如酸枣仁，表面微鼓起，微具焦斑；略有焦香气，味淡。功效同酸枣仁"}]},{"ID":"20240206103143-jodgug8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103143-jodgug8","updated":"20240206103143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103143-ne2weax.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164511-pzguduj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164511-pzguduj","updated":"20240718083144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸枣仁"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸枣仁-20240205164511-i483q2i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 691px;","style":"width: 681px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸枣 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸枣 3-20240718083144-mxm5w2q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 681px;\" parent-style=\"width: 691px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221195317-zkms6c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221195317-zkms6c2","updated":"20240809094635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 376px;","style":"width: 366px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸枣 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸枣 4-20240809094635-gv5nkj9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 366px;\" parent-style=\"width: 376px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 445px;","style":"width: 435px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"酸枣"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/酸枣-20240809094321-d24mjch.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 435px;\" parent-style=\"width: 445px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240809095017-avypgt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240809095017-avypgt1","updated":"20240809095017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"Nod